@startuml
!include _style.puml
top to bottom direction
title 图 4-1a 核心边界与控制类
class AdminController <<boundary>> {
  管理配置与分配()
}
class BusinessController <<boundary>> {
  创建上下文()
  在线校验()
}
class GovernanceController <<boundary>> {
  处理审批复核()
}
class AuthController <<boundary>> {
  管理员认证()
}
class AccountController <<boundary>> {
  管理员账号维护()
}
class RbacService <<control>> {
  维护配置()
  分配与回收角色()
}
class ContextService <<control>> {
  签发上下文()
  计算有效权限()
  批量校验()
}
class GovernanceService <<control>> {
  批准申请()
  关闭复核()
}
class AuthService <<control>> {
  验证管理员或密钥()
  维护会话()
}
class PermissionCache <<control>> {
  查找可重建结果()
  登记事务失效()
}
class WebhookService <<control>> {
  同事务排队()
  条件认领与投递()
}
class "DAO 组件" as DAO <<boundary>> {
  查询与持久化()
}
class AdminPrincipal <<value object>> {
  username
  role
  applicationIds
}
AdminController ..> RbacService
AdminController ..> AdminPrincipal : 范围
BusinessController ..> ContextService
BusinessController ..> RbacService
GovernanceController ..> GovernanceService
AuthController ..> AuthService
AccountController ..> AuthService
RbacService ..> DAO
ContextService ..> DAO
GovernanceService ..> DAO
AuthService ..> DAO
WebhookService ..> DAO
RbacService ..> PermissionCache : 失效
ContextService ..> PermissionCache : 查询
RbacService ..> WebhookService : 外盒
GovernanceService ..> WebhookService : 外盒
note bottom
依赖只表示核心协作；未穷举所有方法或持有字段。
DAO 为持久化边界，不把数据库关系伪装成 Java 继承。
end note
@enduml
